    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1031110/extras/089d0036dab307f80f65b80b24d56f31.webp?t=1719173947\" /></div><br><br><i>After death, there is no memory, no feelings.<br>Found himself at unroaded lands, the vagrant was forced to choose directions. And with that to make decisions about who he should be now.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1031110/extras/089d0036dab307f80f65b80b24d56f31.webp?t=1719173947\" /></div><br><br>Unroaded is a short free <strong>visual novel</strong> (interactive text-based story) with a dark setting. The plot expands in a half-dead world and is complemented by moral choices that will determine your ending.",
